name wallcalendar
category Package
revision 45568
shortdesc A wall calendar class with custom layouts
longdesc This package provides a wall calendar class with custom layouts
longdesc and support for internationalization. It comes with the
longdesc following layouts: Full page photo, the calendar days overlaid
longdesc with opacity Full page photo, the photo above the calendar days
longdesc Small landscape photo, with a calendar grid Year planner
longdesc Thumbnails and captions Varnish mask There is also support for
longdesc loading event marks from a CSV file.
